WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A vehicle needs attention. A helper scans its QR. Reach the registered contacts.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
A phone goes missing. Use your prepared tools. Review reporting guidance.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Your people head out. Share with your circle. Check in along the way.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
A parked car is in the way. Scan and report the concern. Let the owner respond.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
An item is left behind. A finder scans its QR tag. Make a helpful connection.

